WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.567
Week 9: Daily Routine and Reflexive Verbs. sequence a routine say what is happening now compare schedules

2
00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:28.967
Read for the situation. Normalmente Julia se despierta temprano, pero hoy su alarma no funciona. Ahora se viste rápidamente mientras su pareja prepara café y llama a un taxi. Julia normally wakes up early, but today her alarm does not work. She is getting dressed quickly while her partner prepares coffee and calls a taxi.

3
00:00:28.967 --> 00:00:37.707
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:37.707 --> 00:00:44.720
Reading activities. Reading activity 20; Reading activity 21; Reading activity 22

5
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:52.629
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:52.629 --> 00:01:17.799
Model language. Normalmente Julia se despierta temprano. — Julia normally wakes up early. Hoy su alarma no funciona. — Today her alarm isn't working. Ahora se viste rápidamente. — Now she is getting dressed quickly. Su pareja prepara café. — Her partner prepares coffee. Su pareja llama a un taxi. — Her partner calls a taxi.

7
00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:27.718
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
